{
  "additional_concerns": [
    "The request-only calculation is faithful to the question's stipulated harmonised reading. It does not establish that this reading defeats the rival interpretation of footnote 5.",
    "No actual provider classification or SFC request is supplied. The formula delegates those judgments to input facts; structural validation proves neither.",
    "TRUE means activation only. Neither TRUE nor FALSE establishes substantive compliance, SFC satisfaction, confirmation, or freedom from smart-contract vulnerabilities.",
    "The supplied register, valuation and intermediary provisions do not independently expand paragraph 14's trigger. The intermediary issuance provision likewise concerns continuing responsibility, not demonstration activation."
  ],
